Ranges: NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099. `isValidForCity` is used by the bean-validation constraint `ValidPostcodeForCityValidator` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/validation/ValidPostcodeForCityValidator.java`).

