- The `Owner.telephone` field has an E.164 `@Pattern` regex `^\+[0-9]{8,15}$` (Owner.java line 48).

The identity key (see below) treats this stored, already-normalized telephone as the "normalizedTelephone" — there is no field literally named `normalizedTelephone`; the normalized value is stored directly in `telephone`.

**Identity key (owner duplicate detection)** — `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/util/OwnerIdentityKey.java`, method `of(Owner)`:

