public static String of(Owner owner) {
    return orEmpty(owner.getTelephone())
        + SEPARATOR + orEmpty(owner.getEmail())
        + SEPARATOR + orEmpty(owner.getHouseholdId());
}
```

Key = `telephone|email|householdId`. Used by `ClinicServiceImpl.rejectIdentityCollision` (lines 294-301) and mapped to DTO field `identityKey` in `OwnerMapper` (lines 35-36).

